<stack-static>
    <statement><p><p>Achieng borrows Ksh <m>{26\,000}</m> from a SACCO at <m>{11}\%</m> per annum simple interest for <m>{3}</m> years.</p><p>(a) Find the interest.</p><p>Ksh <fillin characters="10" name="ans1"/>  </p><p>(b) Find the total amount to repay.</p><p>Ksh <fillin characters="10" name="ans2"/>  </p></p></statement>
    <solution><p><p>Simple interest is interest on the principal only, the same every year.</p><p>(a) <m>I = \dfrac{PRT}{100} = \dfrac{{26\,000} \times {11} \times {3}}{100} = {8580}</m>, so the interest is Ksh <m>{8580}</m>.</p><p>(b) <m>A = P + I = {26\,000} + {8580} = {34\,580}</m>, so the amount to repay is Ksh <m>{34\,580}</m>.</p></p></solution>
    <answer><p><m>8580</m></p></answer>
    <answer><p><m>34580</m></p></answer>
</stack-static>